Conventions tag vocabulary
title end

paragraph start
Each page has one tags line under its title. The tags are, in order, business-plan, the area key, then the subject words.
paragraph end

paragraph start
A page that has not been written yet also carries the tag stub, and the tag is removed when the page is written.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Tags describe the page and never decide what it means.
paragraph end

